
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Define the language
const lang = 'zh-hant';
---

<BaseLayout title="公司介紹" lang={lang}>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent text-white py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="text-center">公司介紹</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16">
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-6">關於阿波羅保險公司</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">阿波羅保險公司成立於2020年，是Assurances Provencher Verreault的合作伙伴，位於加拿大蒙特利爾南岸Brossard地區。我們專注於為客戶提供優質的保險服務，包括房屋保險、汽車保險和商業保險等多種保險產品。</p>
          <p class="mb-4">我們的團隊成員擁有豐富的保險行業經驗，精通法語、英語、普通話、粵語，能夠為客戶提供母語服務，確保溝通無障礙，並幫助客戶全面瞭解各類保險產品的細節和條款。</p>
          <p>阿波羅保險公司致力於為客戶提供專業、全面的保險解決方案，保護客戶的財產和利益不受損失，讓客戶的生活和工作更加安心。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-light p-8 rounded-lg">
          <img src="/company.png" alt="阿波羅保險公司" class="w-full aspect-video object-cover rounded-lg" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-center mb-10">我們的使命與願景</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-light p-8 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="mb-4 text-primary">使命</h3>
            <p>通過提供專業、透明的保險服務，幫助客戶更好地瞭解和選擇適合自己的保險方案，保護他們的家庭、車輛和企業，讓他們在加拿大的生活更加安心、便利。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-light p-8 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="mb-4 text-primary">願景</h3>
            <p>成為本地社區最受信賴的保險服務提供商，通過專業知識和優質服務，幫助每一位客戶找到最適合的保險方案，實現財產保障和風險管理。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-center mb-10">我們的核心價值觀</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-8 h-8">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">誠信可靠</h3>
            <p>我們以誠信為基礎，為客戶提供透明、可靠的保險服務，建立長期互信關係。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-8 h-8">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">專業高效</h3>
            <p>我們的團隊擁有專業知識和豐富經驗，能夠高效處理客戶需求和保險理賠。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-8 h-8">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">客戶至上</h3>
            <p>我們始終將客戶的需求放在首位，提供個性化的保險方案和貼心的服務體驗。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-light">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6">與阿波羅保險公司合作的優勢</h2>
      <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">選擇阿波羅保險公司，您將獲得專業、貼心的保險服務體驗</p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5h12M9 3v2m1.048 9.5A18.022 18.022 0 016.412 9m6.088 9h7M11 21l5-10 5 10M12.751 5C11.783 10.77 8.07 15.61 3 18.129" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">多語言服務</h3>
          <p>我們提供法語、英語、普通話、粵語服務，消除語言障礙，讓您充分了解保險內容。</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">個性化方案</h3>
          <p>根據您的具體需求定製保險方案，確保保障全面且經濟實惠。</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">快速響應</h3>
          <p>我們承諾迅速回應您的諮詢和需求，提供及時的服務支持。</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">專業團隊</h3>
          <p>我們的團隊擁有豐富的保險行業經驗，能夠為您提供專業建議。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6">聯絡我們瞭解更多</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">如果您想了解更多關於阿波羅保險公司的信息，或有任何保險相關的問題，歡迎隨時聯絡我們。</p>
      <a href={`/${lang}/contact`} class="btn-primary">聯絡我們</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
